  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundaci&#xf3;n CI&#x2011;Atabey - Dominican Blue Carbon Exchange for the Restoration and Conservation of Mangroves in the Provinces of Montecristi and Puerto Plata</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundaci&#xf3;n CI-Atabey&#x2019;s Dominican Blue Carbon Exchange promotes mangrove restoration in Montecristi and Puerto Plata, safeguarding these vital ecosystems. By generating blue carbon credits, the project incentivizes conservation while mitigating climate change. Partnering with local communities, NGOs, and government entities, it integrates sustainable management, monitoring, and environmental education. This initiative enhances biodiversity, strengthens coastal resilience, and supports local livelihoods&#x2014;ensuring mangroves continue their crucial role in carbon sequestration and ecosystem protection.</narrative>
  </description>
